/* News Feed icon tile — matches the AI Intelligence / Trending header lockups. */
/* News Feed headtext is a plain block off-desktop (title + sub stack as before;
   filters fall below within the head). */
/* Flex column EVERYWHERE (not just desktop) so the title→subtext gap actually
