/* Web Sources: a single column (4-down) of accordion dropdowns — each category
   row expands to list its source links. Hairline-separated, clean. */

/* News feed: a responsive 2→1 grid of clean, equal-height story cards. The base
   .news-card is a divider-ROW (edge-to-edge, no chrome); in the grid we override it
   into a real card — reset the row's internal padding (it doubled with the card
