/* ═══ revamp985 — homepage order + tinted band + tool lists ════════════════
   (#img575/576/577) News + Trending lead. The AI Briefing / Explore Topics /
   AI Research Tools trio sits inside ONE tinted band, each on its own white
   surface, so they stop reading as cards inside cards. */

/* The band spans both grid columns and carries the tint. */
.home-band { grid-column: 1 / -1; min-width: 0; }
@media (min-width: 1024px) {
  body.home-search .home-band {
