/* ═══ revamp987 — AI Briefing card: tighter hierarchy, mug always in frame ══
   (#img580-586) Eyebrow → headline → one meta line, so the card reads top-down
   and loses height. Text is allowed further right, as it already is on mobile,
   which lets the AI Research Tools card sit at a more even height beside it. */

/* Keep the RIGHT of the art in frame at every width — the mug lives there, and
