   search bar and the AI Briefings band, so the three line up. */
/* `body:has(.topic-home) .topic-bodyhead` already sets margin at 0,3,0, so the
   bleed has to be written at least that strong or the band silently renders at
   content width. */
body .topic-bodyhead--hero,
.topic-bodyhead--hero {
