   out-specify it.) Non-news views get their breathing room back explicitly. */
html body.tt-on.home-search.app-mode #content,
html body.home-search.tt-on.app-mode #content { padding-top: calc(var(--nav-h) + var(--subnav-height, 80px)) !important; }
