}

/* ═══ revamp1133 — page-title icons darker bg + lighter glyph; section-header
   icons a shade darker than their row chips (#img1219-1227). ════════════════ */
/* (A) Page-title chips (page hero + topic head) → dark navy bg, white glyph. */
