/* ═══ revamp1167 — one head spec for the four standalone page heros ══════════
   Topics / Trending / Prompts render their hero as `.ndp .aii-nav-dd-head`;
   AI Briefings renders the same design as `.page-hero`. Two components meant to
   look identical, drifting: revamp1139 gave the ndp head a 16px bottom pad and
