}

/* ═══ revamp1179 — tab mode: the two page controls move into the body ════════

   "Expand all" (Topics) and "Include Sports Trends" (Trending) ride in the grey
   identity band, which in tab mode is already carrying the page name, the tab
   strip below it and the Change Page picker — three things competing for a
   ~330px middle. Both belong with the list they act on. The Trending page
   already renders its toggle in the body's caption row on the wide layout
   (renderTrendingModal's controlbar); tab mode was hiding it there and showing
   the band copy instead (revamp1168). Reverse that, and give Topics the same
   caption-row treatment its head already provides. */

/* Trending — the toggle rejoins the AI-generated caption, on its line. */
body.tt-on .ndp.aii-nav-dd-trending .trend-sports-toggle[class] {
